        reason: 'omitted html CSS padding:4px 3px 3px is UA; leftover must not keep IndLeft/SpBefore/SpAfter '
            'so Draw collectParaIX does not inset the later glyph '
            '(`tokens.txt` Ind*/Sp* → fo:margin-left 0.114cm vs 0cm / fo:margin-top 0.572cm vs 0.419cm / fo:margin-bottom 0.533cm vs 0.419cm)',
